# Built APKs are published in GitHub Releases, not committed.
APK/
*.apk
# Signing secrets must never be committed (defense in depth).
**/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/SECRETOS_GITHUB_NO_SUBIR.txt
# Firebase settings (CI writes them from a secret).
**/firebase_defines.json
**/google-services.json
